# Quilled Greatwurm {4}{G}{G}, a 7/7 trampler: "Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage during your turn, put that many +1/+1
# counters on it." and "You may cast this card from your graveyard by removing six counters from among creatures you control in addition
# to paying its other costs." Bot1 casts a Memnite and the Greatwurm on turn 1 (Black Lotus {G}{G}{G}, Mox Emerald, Mox Jet, Mox Ruby),
# holding the second Greatwurm. Bot2's Weakness (-2/-1) makes the first a 5/6 and its Mind Twist for 1 discards the second, Bot1's only
# card. On turn 3 both attack unblocked: the Greatwurm deals 5 and gets five counters, the Memnite deals 1 and gets one - six counters, exactly
# enough among the two creatures. On turn 5 the second Greatwurm is cast from the graveyard (Black Lotus #2 and four Moxen pay {4}{G}{G}),
# removing all six: five from the first and the Memnite's (CR 118.3, 601.2f).

